  Complete Sprint 2?

  Closing a sprint on PROJ board cannot be undone.
  1 issue in it is not done.
  Jira sends what is open to the backlog. Anywhere else, it is moved there first, and the sprint is
  closed only once all of it has moved.

  The open issues go to:
    ( ) the backlog
    (*) Sprint 3, the next planned sprint
    ( ) a new sprint, Sprint 4

